    `<section class="panel"><div class="pb"><div class="empty" style="padding:40px 12px"><b>No companies or funds in the registry yet</b>The private registry holds only real companies, rounds and funds entered by the data desk, each with its source. ${own ? `<div class="row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:14px"><button class="btn pri" data-go="studio" href="#studio">Open Data studio</button></div>` : 'Ask your data desk to add them.'}<div class="note" style="margin-top:10px">Your organization's own portfolio companies live under <a class="tk" data-go="pfco" href="#pfco" style="font-family:var(--f-ui)">Portfolio companies</a>.</div></div></div></section>`;
