/* =====================================================================
   Superfinancials — Knowledge pack and offline answer engine
   The pack (kbdata.js, rebuilt monthly) holds sourced market profiles for
   the priority markets, commodities, a finance glossary, a formula
   library, "what happens when…" explainers and playbooks. The data desk
   can override any entry through collection adm_kb (the monthly update
   task writes there), so the pack refreshes without a new release.
   kbAnswer(q) answers a question with NO AI: it finds the countries,
   commodities, instruments, terms and intent in the question, then
   composes a structured answer (KPIs, charts, tables, calculators) from
   the pack plus the platform's own data-desk figures, every figure with
   its as-of date and source. It never invents numbers: when the pack has
   no figure, the answer says so.
   ===================================================================== */
ADM_COLS.push('adm_kb'); ADM.raw.adm_kb = {};
