/* =====================================================================
   Superfinancials — Scenario simulator ("what if" lab)
   Transparent models only: every scenario lists its assumptions with a
   low / central / high value the user can change, and every number it
   produces is calculated in code from those assumptions plus Knowledge
   Base figures (curves, valuations, prices, systemic exposures), each
   with its date. Outputs are ranges, not predictions.
   Each scenario gives: direct impact, second-order effects, affected
   assets, sector winners and losers, institutional exposure, historical
   comparisons, quantitative estimates with ranges, a transmission map
   and indicators to monitor. A custom builder applies user shocks to an
   editable sensitivity table.
   ===================================================================== */
