/* =====================================================================
   Superfinancials — Deep Research
   After any Copilot answer, "Deep research" runs a multi-step
   investigation and returns an institutional research report:
     1  break the question into research areas (AI planner, with a
        keyword planner as the fallback)
     2  gather evidence with local tools: Knowledge Base answers,
        systemic exposure facts, historical episodes, scenario models,
        the knowledge graph, reports, real market data and calculators
        (every calculation runs in code)
     3  write the report (AI, citing evidence ids E1…En), or assemble it
        from the evidence offline when AI isn't available
   Report: executive summary, key findings, evidence with citations,
   historical comparisons, calculations, a risk transmission map,
   bull/base/bear scenarios, most exposed institutions and sectors,
   market implications, confidence and data limitations, investment
   considerations, and an evidence appendix. Exports to PDF, Word and
   PowerPoint (libraries pinned and integrity-checked, loaded on demand).
   ===================================================================== */
